%% Resilience scenario 2 (exclusive tiered): when the secondary fast
%% memory pool fails, requests whose KV blocks lived only there must
%% re-prefill on the accelerator. Slow-pool requests are unaffected.
flowchart LR
    Acc["Accelerator"]
    HBM["HBM"]
    Acc --- HBM

    SecMem["Secondary fast memory pool<br/>(unresponsive)"]:::dead
    Slow["Slow host DRAM pool<br/>(healthy)"]:::ok

    HBM x--x|"high-priority blocks<br/>were exclusively here"| SecMem
    HBM <-->|low-priority blocks<br/>continue normally| Slow

    HBM ==>|"recompute (re-prefill)<br/>requests whose KV<br/>was in the dead tier"| HBM

    classDef dead fill:#fee,stroke:#c00,stroke-dasharray:5 5
    classDef ok fill:#e8f5e0,stroke:#3a8a1a
